Folio
Copyright 2026 Taylor Pridgen

Folio implements the Tachiyomi extension API (package eu.kanade.tachiyomi) so that it can load
extensions published by Keiyoushi (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source). The API's shape
follows keiyoushi/extensions-lib and Mihon (https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon), both licensed under
the Apache License 2.0. Extensions are downloaded at runtime; none are bundled.

The Inter typeface is by The Inter Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(see licenses/Inter-OFL.txt).

The Archivo typeface is by The Archivo Project Authors (Omnibus-Type), licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (see licenses/Archivo-OFL.txt).
